# binary files
*.aar binary
*.sar binary
*.png binary
# QA F4: raster image formats must be treated as binary. Without this, the
# '* text eol=crlf' rule above CRLF-smudges them on checkout (injecting CR
# bytes into the JPEG stream), corrupting the working-tree image so the
# browser renders a broken placeholder. Marking them binary stops the smudge.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
